The ring of slow digestion removes intrinsic hunger, so you're left with
only ring-, amulet- and conflict-hunger. There will be at least one ring -
the ring of slow digestion. How should the intrinsic behave? Absolute zero
hunger when no rings or amulets are worn? Or one additional ring hunger
always active?

I don't play monks much, so I can't say how this would affect gameplay, but
I guess that it is intended to be more of an annoyance? At XL19, you
usually have many (vegetarian) rations to feed from, so SD isn't critical,
but staying satiated for too long can be negative. I don't know how this
would affect a monk, but it might be a nice idea.

